---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="404 - 找不到頁面" description="很抱歉，您要找的頁面不存在。">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[60vh] px-4 text-center">
        <div class="text-9xl mb-4">🙈</div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">找不到頁面</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg mb-8 max-w-md">
            糟糕！您可能迷路了。您所尋找的頁面可能已被移除、名稱更改或暫時無法使用。
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 mb-12">
            <a href="/twopiggyhavefun-blog/" 
               class="bg-[#337ab7] text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-blue-600 transition shadow-lg flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>🏠</span> 返回首頁
            </a>
            <a href="/twopiggyhavefun-blog/category/travel" 
               class="bg-white text-gray-700 border border-gray-300 px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-50 transition shadow-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                <span>✈️</span> 探索旅遊文章
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto">
            <p class="text-gray-500 mb-2 text-sm">或者試試看搜尋？</p>
            <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                <form action="/twopiggyhavefun-blog/search" method="get" class="flex">
                    <input type="text" name="q" placeholder="例如：台北美食..." class="flex-1 px-4 py-2 bg-transparent focus:outline-none" required />
                    <button type="submit" class="bg-gray-800 text-white px-6 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-700 transition">搜尋</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
